WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.201
-I am here with John Cena

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:04.136
and he and I...
[ Rimshot ]

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.305
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.972
...are getting ready to go
head-to-head --

00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:09.608
or face-to-face --
in a game of "Facebreakers."

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:10.943
-Yeah, that's right.
-Now, here's how it works.

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:12.945
We're going to take turns
throwing footballs

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.481
at that wall of glass
with our faces on it.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.885
The first person to break all
of their opponent's faces wins.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.553
[ Laughter ]
There's John's face.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.890
-Yep.
-And there is my face,
right there.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.191
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.059
Couldn't we have gotten
a better face for my face?

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:28.861
[ Laughter ]
-It looks good.

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:31.297
-It looks like I was wearing
like sunglasses

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.731
or like a suntanning --

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:34.233
Why do I have lines in my hair?

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:35.368
-Oh, I just noticed that.

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.603
-It's every man for himself.

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.671
John, are you ready to start
breaking face?

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.972
-I'm not, but let's go.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.442
-Alright, you are my guest,
so you will go first.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.843
Please, John Cena.
-Alright, let's do this.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.512
Alright.
Do we have to stand

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.779
on the shamrock?
-Yeah, yeah, that's a shamrock

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:47.980
-Yes, okay.
-for good luck.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.216
[ The Roots playing funk ]

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.951
[ Audience ohs ]

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.285
-Got a little too excited!

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:55.488
-Come on!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:57.690
[ Audience ohs ]
♪♪

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.025
-Here we go.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:00.493
Alright, here we go.
We got this.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.829
Alright, let me show you
how it's done.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.430
-We're building the suspense.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.765
-Go back and then go forward.

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:06.899
Wham! Boom!

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:08.634
[ Rimshot ]
-Ooh!
-What's up?!

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.502
[ Cheering and applause ]
What's up?!

00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:11.838
That's one down.
That's one down.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.272
♪♪

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:15.641
[ Audience ohs ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:16.742
-[ Announcer voice ]
With the grace

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:19.111
of a beardless Dan Fouts.

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:21.581
♪♪

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.416
[ Cheering and applause ]
-That was good.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.384
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:28.054
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:30.189
-I told you we were
building suspense!

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.991
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Dude.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.693
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.195
-Ohhh!

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:36.595
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:36.595 --> 00:01:37.797
-This is so exciting.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.500
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.034
-You bastard!
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:44.870
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.339
[ Rimshot ]
-Alright!

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:48.140
Yeah, I got home field.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.643
♪♪

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:53.446
[ Audience ohs ]
♪♪

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.214
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:55.214 --> 00:01:58.318
-Dude, you got a good arm.
That was good follow through

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:00.553
on that one.
-Coach Howell could be proud.

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:03.189
♪♪

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:04.257
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Dude.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.859
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:09.629
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.163
-It's close. It's close.
-This is a close game.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.698
This is a close game.
I love this.

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:14.867
♪♪

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:16.001
[ Cheering and applause ]
-I don't like you.

00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:18.204
[ Rimshot ]
-Dude.

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:20.840
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.041
Dude, what is going on?

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.709
-I don't know!
-This is amazing.

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:25.178
I should try out for the NFL.

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:27.079
[ Laughter ]
This is the best I've ever
done in my life.

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:28.614
♪♪

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:29.882
-[ Announcer voice ]
Wearing the colors

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:32.318
of Ken Stabler,

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.386
he tries for the long pass.

00:02:34.386 --> 00:02:36.856
I got to throw it
a little touch.

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.157
[ Audience ohs ]
Oh!

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:40.926
♪♪

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:41.928
[ Audience ohs ]
-Ooh!

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:46.065
-Alright.
I got to hit the high one.

00:02:46.065 --> 00:02:50.203
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:52.705
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.007
-Alright, I got to get two.

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:56.843
Oof, oof, oof, oof,
oof, oof, oof.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:59.579
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:00.646
-Ohhh!

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:03.482
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:03:03.482 --> 00:03:11.056
[ Cheering intensifies ]
♪♪

00:03:11.056 --> 00:03:12.525
-I would like
to offer you a draw.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.962
Audience:
No!

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:17.863
-No way!
-Okay, fine!

00:03:17.863 --> 00:03:19.398
-No way! Good luck!
-Fine, that's fine.

00:03:19.398 --> 00:03:20.566
You don't want the draw?
-Good luck!

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:21.667
I don't want the draw!
-Then fine!

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:24.303
-Let's go!
-Eat this, Fallon!

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:26.039
[ Drumroll ]

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:27.039
[ Audience ohs ]

00:03:27.039 --> 00:03:29.976
-You're going down, buddy!

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.111
[ Audience ohs ]
-Should we go with the draw?!

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:33.212
-No!
We got to --

00:03:33.212 --> 00:03:34.713
Are we out of footballs?

00:03:34.713 --> 00:03:36.449
-Throw the buckets.
-Throw the buckets.

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:38.217
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.152
-Fine.

00:03:40.152 --> 00:03:41.553
We throw the buckets.
-Yeah, throw the buckets.

00:03:41.553 --> 00:03:43.088
-Do I go first?
-Yeah, I'll go --

00:03:43.088 --> 00:03:44.790
-Should we simultaneously throw?
-Simultaneously throw.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:45.958
Ready?
-Alright.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.260
-Throw the bucket.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.495
-On 3?
-1...

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:52.631
-Is it 1, 2, 3, throw?
-1, 2, 3, throw.

00:03:52.631 --> 00:03:53.900
-1, 2, 3, throw.
-Yep.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.303
-[Both] 1, 2, 3.

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:58.604
[ Thudding ]

00:03:58.604 --> 00:04:03.142
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:04.977
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:06.812
-That's how you build suspense!

00:04:06.812 --> 00:04:09.381
[ Laughing ] That's how
you build suspense.

00:04:09.381 --> 00:04:12.184
-[ Laughing ]

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:14.086
That was the way to do it,
right there.

00:04:14.086 --> 00:04:15.988
John Cena!
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:15.988 --> 00:04:17.857
[ Rimshot ]
That's the champion.

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.391
That's the champ, right there.

00:04:19.391 --> 00:04:21.894
"Vacation Friends"
is streaming on Hulu now.

